<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>Insider status · bitcoin++</title>
  {{ block "header" . }} {{ end }}
</head>
<body class="btcpp-profile-edit-page account-settings-page">
  {{ block "mainnav" . }} {{ end }}
  {{ template "dashboard_tabs" (dict "Active" "insider" "ShowHackathons" .HasHackathonProjects "ShowSponsors" .ShowSponsors "ShowAdmin" .IsGlobalAdmin "PendingOrgInviteCount" .PendingOrgInviteCount) }}

  <main class="profile-edit-shell person-emails-page">
    <header class="profile-edit-hero account-settings-hero">
      <div class="account-settings-hero__copy">
        <p class="profile-edit-tag">§ INSIDER EDITION</p>
        <h1>Your Insider <span>status.</span></h1>
        <p>This is a private, read-only status mirrored from Insider Edition. Manage billing, purchases, newsletters, pauses, and delivery cadence on Insider.</p>
      </div>
      <dl class="account-settings-hero__facts" aria-label="Insider status summary">
        <div><dt>Access tier</dt><dd>{{ if .Projection }}{{ .Projection.SubscriberTier }}{{ else }}none{{ end }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Email</dt><dd>{{ if .Projection }}{{ .Projection.NewsletterStatus }}{{ else }}not subscribed{{ end }}</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </header>

    <section class="profile-edit-section is-open">
      <div class="profile-edit-section__index">ACL</div>
      <div class="profile-edit-section__body">
        <div class="profile-edit-section__head"><div><p>§ STATUS ONLY</p><h2>Insider owns the details</h2></div></div>
        <p>Bitcoin++ knows only whether your current Insider tier is <strong>none</strong>, <strong>free</strong>, or <strong>paid</strong>, plus a coarse subscribed/not-subscribed email status. It does not manage your payment method, purchases, newsletter selections, or notification schedule.</p>
        <p><a href="{{ .ManageURL }}">Manage Insider membership and delivery →</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  {{ block "footer" . }}{{ end }}
</body>
</html>
